      "id": "claim_d5d2c884f05e48659e2047c261720386",
      "statement": "agent_catalog(config, surface) in openswe/server.py is the factory that assembles the primary coding agent per executable thread run on Managed Deep Agents, resolving its sandbox, model policy, tool surface, subagent, skills, backend, and middleware by populating a ToolSurface object before MDA executes it.",
